#: ../../benchmarks.rst:323
msgid ""
"In forward-auth mode the daemon is not the bottleneck. Its cores busy "
"(CPU time over wall time, ``cores_busy_median`` in the JSON file) stay "
"between 2.47 and 2.72 of the four daemon CPUs, and every row lies between "
"197,532 and 211,636 requests per second. That points to the load "
"generator as the ceiling. Near that ceiling a difference of a few percent "
"between rows moves between runs: the Gate ``admitted`` row alone spans "
"205,151 to 211,513 requests per second over its three runs. The more "
"useful figure in this mode is CPU time per request: 11.73 to 13.77 us, a "
"little more for Shield than for Gate, and most for the ``challenged`` "
"rows, which render the challenge answer."
msgstr ""
"在 forward-auth 模式下，守护进程不是瓶颈。它的忙碌核心数（CPU 时间除以实际时间，即 JSON 文件中的 "
"``cores_busy_median``）保持在四个守护进程 CPU 中的 2.47 到 2.72 之间，每一行都在每秒 197,532 到 "
"211,636 个请求之间。这表明上限来自负载生成器。在这个上限附近，行与行之间几个百分点的差异会随运行而变化：仅 Gate 的 "
"``admitted`` 这一行，三次运行就从每秒 205,151 到 211,513 个请求不等。在这种模式下更有用的数字是每请求 CPU "
"时间：11.73 到 13.77 us，Shield 比 Gate 略多，``challenged`` 各行最多，因为它们要渲染挑战应答。"

