msgstr "练习 8.1"

#: ../../benchmarks.rst:921
msgid ""
"Run ``cargo xtask bench primitives`` on another machine and compare the "
"Hashcash verification and token verification rows with the reference "
"host. Which of the two depends most on hardware hash instructions, and "
"why?"
msgstr ""
"在另一台机器上运行 ``cargo xtask bench primitives``，把 Hashcash "
"验证和令牌验证这两行与参考主机进行比较。两者中哪一个更依赖硬件哈希指令，为什么？"

#: ../../benchmarks.rst:923
msgid "Exercise 8.2"
msgstr "练习 8.2"

#: ../../benchmarks.rst:925
msgid ""
"In the forward-auth table, compute the cores busy of a row: its CPU "
"microseconds per request times its requests per second, divided by one "
"million. Was the daemon CPU bound? Then compare its CPU microseconds per "
"request with the classification cost from the first table. Why is the "
"per-request CPU cost so much higher, and which components account for the "
"difference?"
msgstr ""
"在 forward-auth 表中，计算某一行的忙碌核心数：它的每请求 CPU 微秒数乘以它的每秒请求数，再除以一百万。守护进程是否受 CPU "
"限制？然后把它的每请求 CPU 微秒数与第一张表中的分类成本比较。为什么每请求的 CPU 成本高出这么多？哪些组成部分造成了这一差异？"

#: ../../benchmarks.rst:927
msgid ""
"*Hint:* list everything between ``accept`` and the flushed response that "
"the primitive suite does not time."
msgstr "*提示：* 列出从 ``accept`` 到响应被刷新之间、原语测试套件没有计时的所有内容。"

#: ../../benchmarks.rst:929
msgid "Explain the invariant"
msgstr "解释这个不变量"

#: ../../benchmarks.rst:931
msgid ""
"Every figure in this part is a median over repetitions, with its spread "
"beside it. Explain the difference between a median-of-batches figure and "
"a per-request p99.9, why the primitive table reports the former and the "
"latency table the latter, and why only the latter could reveal the "
"thread-turnover stall described above."
msgstr ""
"本部分的每个数字都是多次重复的中位数，旁边列出其离散范围。解释批次中位数与每请求 p99.9 "
"之间的区别，为什么原语表报告前者而延迟表报告后者，以及为什么只有后者才能揭示上面描述的线程更替卡顿。"
